OL,3,GNEWSAThe country house that inspired
OL,4,AAgatha Christie's novels
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnown as the Queen of Crime, Agatha
OL,7,FChristie murder mysteries have
OL,8,Fcaptivated audiences for more than a
OL,9,Fcentury.
OL,11,FBut it might come as a surprise to some
OL,12,Fthat many of her stories were inspired
OL,13,Fby a country house in Cheadle, Greater
OL,14,FManchester.
OL,16,FAbney Hall is the subject of a new
OL,17,Fepisode of Hidden Manchester on BBC
OL,18,FSounds after the Cheadle Civic Society
OL,19,Ferected an information board in the
OL,20,Fgrounds explaining the novelist's
OL,21,Fconnections.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
