OL,3,GNEWSAThe country house that inspired
OL,4,AAgatha Christie's novels
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1902, Christie first arrived at
OL,7,FAbney Hall when she was about 11 years
OL,8,Fold as her older sister Madge lived at
OL,9,Fthe house after marrying into the
OL,10,Fwealthy Watts family.
